      "raw": "# Windows validation (2026-10-19)\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Windows validation (2026-10-19)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "The MSVC x64 Release build completes with Qt 6.8.3 and CMake 4.4.4. On a\ncase-insensitive filesystem, the C runtime's `memory.h` lookup can reach the\nSDK's `Memory.h` inside an `extern \"C\"` block. Its C++ declarations now explicitly\nretain C++ linkage. The MemoryHeaderInterop regression includes that header\ninside C linkage and verifies both C memory functions and the native RAM query.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "The full build contains 73 CTest suites. After a complete run and a focused\nretry with Git for Windows available, 66 suites pass. Seven suites still fail:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 11,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
